1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,133
What are we doing here?

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,100
I just want to make sure
that no one wants to hurt you.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:12,167
- [PHONE RINGING]
- [STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:16,567
[CHIEF] Hello, Sir Nabong?

5
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:18,700
Hello, Chief. I have something
to report.

6
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:20,700
<i> It's good you called.</i>

7
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,500
According to the forensic
report,

8
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:25,067
someone sabotaged Don Nato.

9
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,700
What?

10
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:28,267
How?

11
00:00:28,467 --> 00:00:30,433
<i>The yacht did not capsize
by accident.</i>

12
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:34,067
It was on purpose
to destroy your clan.

13
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,367
I knew it.

14
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,400
Chief, I'll put you on speaker.

15
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:42,500
Chief, I have here with me
a distant relative of Don Nato.

16
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,500
She almost got into
an accident earlier.

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,167
Hello, Chief? I'm uh, I'm June!

18
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,433
Well...

19
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,667
a flower pot fell earlier.

20
00:00:51,667 --> 00:00:53,600
I thought it was just a cat!

21
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,267
<i> Be careful!</i>

22
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,333
Most of them, they're close
to the family.

23
00:00:58,333 --> 00:01:00,567
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

24
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:02,733
I think I know
who's the mastermind.

25
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,433
I already know who it is.

26
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,567
My brother told me.

27
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:17,467
<i> Hello!</i>

28
00:01:18,533 --> 00:01:20,133
[IN UNISON] Attorney Zia!

29
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:27,100
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]
